    a: "Start leasing as units are delivered, at a net absorption pace taken from comparable buildings that opened recently, until occupancy reaches a stabilized level, often around 93–95%. Price leases at market rents trended to delivery, less upfront concessions such as a month free. NOI builds with occupancy and stabilizes once the concessions burn off.",
