    example: "[[300]] units at [[20]] net leases a month to [[94%]] occupancy: 282 units, about 14 months. At [[15]] a month it takes about 19 months, five more months of carry. A month free on 282 leases at [[$2,400]] gives up $677K of rent.",
    trap: "Don't let NOI stabilize the day occupancy does. The last leases signed still have their free rent ahead of them and the first renewals bring turnover, so stabilized NOI usually lags stabilized occupancy by a few months."
